menu "SleepCube M2 validation"

config SC_ENABLE_TOUCH_DEBUG_AUDIO
    bool "Enable touch-debug generated audio sources"
    default n
    help
        Adds volatile music/sine source selection and C3..C8 generated tones
        to the semantic UART endpoint. Development images only.

config SC_M2_ENDURANCE_BUILD
    bool "Build the finite 60-minute M2 endurance image"
    default n
    help
        Retains the explicit M2 endurance build identity. The R00 product and
        endurance profiles now both use a finite 60-minute default; this option
        does not create a runtime API for unbounded playback.

endmenu
